e their $5.95 lunches. (Hey, common'-- what do you want for $5.95??) I had their Taco lunch today and it was awesome. Fridays, it's their fried catfish-- the best in the city. Incredible that they can serve this for $5.95. With iced tea, my bill came to $8 and change. My-o-my, talk about a great restaurant for a recession. (Wait. Oh, I forgot, the recession ended. Yeah, right.)"},{"business_id":"Fn5kDzO8OWOqoLYkeO2gLg","review_id":"QfqvX2el2yrZrsx2BYhqHw","date":"2013-01-17T01:33:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.8956888914108276,"text_excerpt":"This place is closed for good. Signs on the windows/doors state so. It had decent food when I went once, but there was hardly any business. It's a shame since I work so close."}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
